= Max Hoelz

Max Hoelz, the Vogtland rebel of the Kapp days, has come to Mansfeld with a few hundred armed men. [? if kapd_exists = 1 : We expelled him last year; he is closer to the KAPD now than to us. ?] He blows up railway lines, robs banks and post offices to pay his fighters, and burns the villas of the mine directors. The workers love him. The press calls him the red general, and the bandit.

- @arms: Send him arms and a liaison officer.
- @discipline: Bring his men under the strike committees.
- @disown: Disown his robberies and bombs.

@arms
subtitle: [? if lock_uprising = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] The Left's line: every rifle counts. The Spartacists are appalled.
choose-if: lock_uprising < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids armed action.
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.lock_uprising == 1) {
    Q.unity -= 10;
    Q[Q.leading_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 10;
}
Q.e21_ma_hoelz = 1;
Q.crisis_momentum += 8;
